    "text": "Wǒ xǐhuan means I like. 我喜欢狗: I like dogs.",
    "examples": [
      "我喜欢猫: I like cats",
      "我喜欢红色: I like red"
    ],
    "reteach": "Start with 我 (I), then 喜欢 (like), then the thing you like."
